    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabriel, a middle-aged man isolated in the depths of his own mind, awakens in a strange and desolate world. To escape, he must confront powerful entities\u2014manifestations of his fear, guilt, and painful memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This atmospheric action game challenges players with intense, one-on-one encounters against symbolic bosses. With minimalist mechanics and a focus on timing, observation, and precision, every fight is a test of both skill and understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting landscape shaped by emotion and memory. Piece together fragments of Gabriel\u2019s past as you uncover the reasons behind his solitude\u2014and whether there is a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, focused combat with high-stakes encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbolic bosses representing psychological themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary journey through surreal, emotional environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI and storytelling through the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront the monsters within \u2014 and discover whether redemption lies at the end of the mind\u2019s labyrinth.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabriel, a middle-aged man isolated in the depths of his own mind, awakens in a strange and desolate world. To escape, he must confront powerful entities\u2014manifestations of his fear, guilt, and painful memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This atmospheric action game challenges players with intense, one-on-one encounters against symbolic bosses. With minimalist mechanics and a focus on timing, observation, and precision, every fight is a test of both skill and understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting landscape shaped by emotion and memory. Piece together fragments of Gabriel\u2019s past as you uncover the reasons behind his solitude\u2014and whether there is a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, focused combat with high-stakes encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbolic bosses representing psychological themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary journey through surreal, emotional environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI and storytelling through the world itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack and visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to confront the monsters within \u2014 and discover whether redemption lies at the end of the mind\u2019s labyrinth.</p>",
